    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/f6629e453a56f362a9e431e393194d1f.poster.avif?t=1750934247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/f6629e453a56f362a9e431e393194d1f.webm?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/f6629e453a56f362a9e431e393194d1f.mp4?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Congratulations, you're finally a Frontiersman! You're being sent on a special assignment- to venture out into the wild unknown and aid a diverse community of colorful characters. <strong>You must establish a farm, breed your friends, and fight against evildoers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything is sunshine and rainbows though, poachers are disturbing the natural ecosystem of the frontiers you have sworn to protect. <strong>Team up with your monsterfolk partners to fight back those who seek to exploit the land on behalf of their own greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/7798fbfa35984c61c8d4e06e3e65d9b0.poster.avif?t=1750934247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/7798fbfa35984c61c8d4e06e3e65d9b0.webm?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/7798fbfa35984c61c8d4e06e3e65d9b0.mp4?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Equal parts farming simulator &amp; turn-based RPG, there's always something new around the corner! Here are just a few of the things you can do in Cloud Meadow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cultivate A Cozy Farm-</strong> plant seeds, grow crops, take charge of your personal homestead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Baddies-</strong> engage in satisfying hybrid active-turn-based RPG battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sexual Shenanigans-</strong> breed and bond with your colleagues! Over 50 animated sex scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting &amp; Customization-</strong> cooking, party customization, farm upgrades! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/a76cf82a0cdc07f03cb90146487048b3.poster.avif?t=1750934247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/a76cf82a0cdc07f03cb90146487048b3.webm?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/a76cf82a0cdc07f03cb90146487048b3.mp4?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/f6629e453a56f362a9e431e393194d1f.poster.avif?t=1750934247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/f6629e453a56f362a9e431e393194d1f.webm?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/f6629e453a56f362a9e431e393194d1f.mp4?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Congratulations, you're finally a Frontiersman! You're being sent on a special assignment- to venture out into the wild unknown and aid a diverse community of colorful characters. <strong>You must establish a farm, breed your friends, and fight against evildoers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything is sunshine and rainbows though, poachers are disturbing the natural ecosystem of the frontiers you have sworn to protect. <strong>Team up with your monsterfolk partners to fight back those who seek to exploit the land on behalf of their own greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/7798fbfa35984c61c8d4e06e3e65d9b0.poster.avif?t=1750934247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/7798fbfa35984c61c8d4e06e3e65d9b0.webm?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/7798fbfa35984c61c8d4e06e3e65d9b0.mp4?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Equal parts farming simulator &amp; turn-based RPG, there's always something new around the corner! Here are just a few of the things you can do in Cloud Meadow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cultivate A Cozy Farm-</strong> plant seeds, grow crops, take charge of your personal homestead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Baddies-</strong> engage in satisfying hybrid active-turn-based RPG battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sexual Shenanigans-</strong> breed and bond with your colleagues! Over 50 animated sex scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting &amp; Customization-</strong> cooking, party customization, farm upgrades! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/a76cf82a0cdc07f03cb90146487048b3.poster.avif?t=1750934247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/a76cf82a0cdc07f03cb90146487048b3.webm?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/a76cf82a0cdc07f03cb90146487048b3.mp4?t=1750934247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
